flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-riscv-fuzz: Trust boundary shows what must be proven rather than believed."]
    N2["2. Trusted base: PolkaVM semantics, host syscall rules, gas policy"]
    N3["3. Untrusted input: seed corpus | generated opcodes | mutated stack values"]
    N4["4. Validation boundary: ABI, gas, syscall, host context, and execution result must match"]
    N5["5. Replay and ordering: execution context binds call, state, and gas to prevent cross-context reuse"]
    N6["6. Authority: guest cannot mutate chain state directly; host/syscall boundary authorizes effects"]
    N7["7. External systems: PolkaVM, L2 node, host services, contract tooling"]
    N8["8. Observed evidence: gas, syscalls, host trace, halt/fault, and execution digest"]
    N1 --> N2
    N1 --> N3
    N1 --> N4
    N1 --> N5
    N1 --> N6
    N1 --> N7
    N1 --> N8
    N2 -. constrains .-> N4
    N4 -. produces .-> N5
    N5 -. consumed by .-> N6
